{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>fell.</b> Dwelt — as in ״וּמִדְיָן וַעֲמָלֵק וּבְנֵי קֶדֶם נֹפְלִים בָּעֵמֶק״ (Judges 7). Here it uses the term of falling, and further on it says ״עַל פְּנֵי כָל אֶחָיו יִשְׁכֹּן״ (Genesis 16:12)? Before Abraham died — he dwelt; from when Abraham died — he fell."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:00:26.395599055Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}